    "title": "California students post gains in math, science and English in 2025-26 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Robert Sheridan ,\n10 hours ago SACRAMENTO, Calif. — California students made gains across key academic and success measures during the 2025-26 school year, with test scores rising in English, math and science while the statewide graduation rate reached a record high of 87.9 percent. For the first time, the state released assessment results and California School Dashboard data together to give families and educators a more complete picture of student performance. Read full article\n4",
